{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: an employee submits an expense report, the finance team reviews it, and then the report is archived.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_expense", "name": "Expense reporting", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Expense report submitted"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "userTask", "name": "Review expense report"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Archive report"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Report archived"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "t2"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "linear"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: after a loan application is received, an officer assesses it. If approved, disburse the funds; if rejected, notify the applicant. Either way the process ends.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_loan", "name": "Loan approval", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Application received"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "userTask", "name": "Assess application"}, {"id": "g1", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "Approved?"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Disburse funds"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "sendTask", "name": "Notify applicant of rejection"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Application processed"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "g1"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t2", "name": "approved", "condition": "decision == 'approved'"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t3", "name": "rejected", "condition": "decision == 'rejected'"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "end"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "xor-split-merge"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: when an order is placed, check inventory and process payment at the same time; once both are done, ship the order.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_order", "name": "Order fulfilment", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Order placed"}, {"id": "split", "type": "parallelGateway", "name": "Fork"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Check inventory"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Process payment"}, {"id": "join", "type": "parallelGateway", "name": "Join"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Ship order"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Order shipped"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "split"}, {"source": "split", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "split", "target": "t2"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "join"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "join"}, {"source": "join", "target": "t3"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "parallel-split-join"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: an author drafts a document, then a reviewer reviews it. If changes are requested, the author revises and it is reviewed again; this repeats until the document is approved, after which it is published.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_review", "name": "Document review loop", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Draft requested"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "userTask", "name": "Draft document"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "userTask", "name": "Review document"}, {"id": "g1", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "Approved?"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "userTask", "name": "Revise document"}, {"id": "t4", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Publish document"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Document published"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "t2"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "g1"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t4", "name": "approved", "condition": "approved == true"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t3", "name": "changes requested", "condition": "approved == false"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "t2"}, {"source": "t4", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "loop"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: after sending a quote to a customer, wait for their reply. If a reply arrives, record the response; if no reply arrives within five days, cancel the quote.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_quote", "name": "Quote follow-up", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Quote ready"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "sendTask", "name": "Send quote to customer"}, {"id": "eg", "type": "eventBasedGateway", "name": "Await reply"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "intermediateCatchEvent", "name": "Reply received"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "intermediateCatchEvent", "name": "5 days elapsed"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "userTask", "name": "Record response"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Cancel quote"}, {"id": "end1", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Response recorded"}, {"id": "end2", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Quote cancelled"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "eg"}, {"source": "eg", "target": "e1"}, {"source": "eg", "target": "e2"}, {"source": "e1", "target": "t2"}, {"source": "e2", "target": "t3"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "end1"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "end2"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "event-based-gateway"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: when a support ticket is closed, notify the customer by email and, if the issue was severe, also send an SMS. Both notifications can happen. Then close the case.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_notify", "name": "Ticket closure notifications", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Ticket closed"}, {"id": "g1", "type": "inclusiveGateway", "name": "Choose channels"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "sendTask", "name": "Send email notification"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "sendTask", "name": "Send SMS notification"}, {"id": "g2", "type": "inclusiveGateway", "name": "Merge"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Close case"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Case closed"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "g1"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t1", "name": "always", "condition": "true"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t2", "name": "if severe", "condition": "severity == 'high'"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "g2"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "g2"}, {"source": "g2", "target": "t3"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "inclusive-gateway"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: a new hire is onboarded via an onboarding sub-process, after which their manager is informed.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_onboard", "name": "Employee onboarding", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "New hire accepted"}, {"id": "sp", "type": "subProcess", "name": "Onboard new hire"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "sendTask", "name": "Inform manager"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Onboarding complete"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "sp"}, {"source": "sp", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "subprocess"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: assess an insurance claim's risk using a decision service, then if high risk route to manual review, otherwise auto-approve; the process then ends.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_claim", "name": "Claim risk routing", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Claim submitted"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "businessRuleTask", "name": "Assess claim risk"}, {"id": "g1", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "High risk?"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "userTask", "name": "Manual review"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Auto-approve claim"}, {"id": "g2", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "Merge"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Claim handled"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "g1"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t2", "name": "high", "condition": "risk == 'high'"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t3", "name": "low", "condition": "risk != 'high'"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "g2"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "g2"}, {"source": "g2", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "business-rule-task"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: after a purchase requisition is created, wait two days for budget confirmation, then place the purchase order.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_req", "name": "Requisition wait", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Requisition created"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "intermediateCatchEvent", "name": "Wait 2 days"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Place purchase order"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Order placed"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "e1"}, {"source": "e1", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "intermediate-timer"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: a customer registration process where the customer fills a form, the system validates the data, and if valid the account is created, otherwise the customer is asked to correct the form and resubmit.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_register", "name": "Customer registration", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Registration started"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "userTask", "name": "Fill registration form"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Validate data"}, {"id": "g1", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "Data valid?"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "serviceTask", "name": "Create account"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Account created"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "t2"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "g1"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t3", "name": "valid", "condition": "valid == true"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t1", "name": "invalid", "condition": "valid == false"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "validation-loop"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: receive an incoming application message that starts the process, review the application, and send an acknowledgement.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_app", "name": "Application intake", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Application message received"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "userTask", "name": "Review application"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "sendTask", "name": "Send acknowledgement"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Applicant acknowledged"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "t2"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "message-intake"}}
{"instruction": "Generate a BPMN 2.0 diagram: for an equipment maintenance request, a technician inspects the equipment; based on the inspection either repair it or replace it, then verify the work and close the request.", "ir": {"process_id": "Process_maint", "name": "Equipment maintenance", "nodes": [{"id": "start", "type": "startEvent", "name": "Maintenance requested"}, {"id": "t1", "type": "userTask", "name": "Inspect equipment"}, {"id": "g1", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "Repair or replace?"}, {"id": "t2", "type": "userTask", "name": "Repair equipment"}, {"id": "t3", "type": "userTask", "name": "Replace equipment"}, {"id": "g2", "type": "exclusiveGateway", "name": "Merge"}, {"id": "t4", "type": "userTask", "name": "Verify work"}, {"id": "end", "type": "endEvent", "name": "Request closed"}], "edges": [{"source": "start", "target": "t1"}, {"source": "t1", "target": "g1"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t2", "name": "repairable", "condition": "action == 'repair'"}, {"source": "g1", "target": "t3", "name": "beyond repair", "condition": "action == 'replace'"}, {"source": "t2", "target": "g2"}, {"source": "t3", "target": "g2"}, {"source": "g2", "target": "t4"}, {"source": "t4", "target": "end"}]}, "meta": {"source": "first-party-authored", "pattern": "xor-with-rejoin"}}
